dingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Part 4: Okay, let's have some fun. Here, you will be presented with an advertisement about Nike shoes. Then, you will be asked some questions about the ad, spokesperson, and the product being advertised. &nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Are you ready? Click the play button in the video next page.<\/strong><\/span><\/div>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9EMz4vUv85Ya5cF","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID35","SecondaryAttribute":"Part 5: In this section, you will be asked about your purchasing behavior. \u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71431463-93a5-ba74-d1e5-27350eef83e8\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent;\">Part 5: In this section, you will be asked about your purchasing behavior.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q8.1","QuestionID":"QID35","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Part 5: In this section, you will be asked about your purchasing behavior. \u00a0","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71431463-93a5-ba74-d1e5-27350eef83e8\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent;\">Part 5: In this section, you will be asked about your purchasing behavior.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9EMz4vUv85Ya5cF","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID33","SecondaryAttribute":"Part 6: Okay, we are almost done. This part deals with demographic questions for the statistical...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71431463-92f4-3198-f992-ed01a9a56911\"><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71431463-93a7-9813-c8fd-86c67f117dc9\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Part 6:<\/span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Okay, we are almost done. This part deals with demographic questions for the statistical purpose only. Your response will remain anonymous, and will be looked at at an aggregate level only after being combined with those of all other participants.<\/span><\/p><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q9.1","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Part 6: Okay, we are almost done. This part deals with demographic questions for the statistical...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID33","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71431463-92f4-3198-f992-ed01a9a56911\"><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71431463-93a7-9813-c8fd-86c67f117dc9\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Part 6:<\/span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Okay, we are almost done. This part deals with demographic questions for the statistical purpose only. Your response will remain anonymous, and will be looked at at an aggregate level only after being combined with those of all other participants.<\/span><\/p><\/span>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9EMz4vUv85Ya5cF","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID10","SecondaryAttribute":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.<div><br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q12","QuestionID":"QID10","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"On a website"},"2":{"Display":"On a social media platform"},"3":{"Display":"On TV"},"4":{"Display":"On a billboard"},"5":{"Display":"In a magazine"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1-Very likely"},"2":{"Display":"2-likely"},"3":{"Display":"3-Neutral"},"4":{"Display":"4-Unlikely"},"5":{"Display":"5-Very unlikely"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.<div><br><\/div>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9EMz4vUv85Ya5cF","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID28","SecondaryAttribute":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, 'Trebuchet MS'; font-size: 13px;\">Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.<\/span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, 'Trebuchet MS'; font-size: 13px;\"><br><\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q4.4","QuestionID":"QID28","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"On TV "},"2":{"Display":"In magazines or newspapers"},"3":{"Display":"On a website"},"4":{"Display":"On a social media platform"},"5":{"Display":"On billboards or posters"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1-Never"},"2":{"Display":"2-Sometimes"},"3":{"Display":"3-About half the time"},"4":{"Display":"4-Most of the time"},"5":{"Display":"5-Frequently"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, 'Trebuchet MS'; font-size: 13px;\">Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.<\/span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, 'Trebuchet MS'; font-size: 13px;\"><br><\/span><\/div>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9EMz4vUv85Ya5cF","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID41","SecondaryAttribute":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.<div><br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"On a website"},"2":{"Display":"On a social media platform"},"3":{"Display":"On TV"},"4":{"Display":"On a billboard"},"5":{"Display":"In a magazine"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1-Very likely"},"2":{"Display":"2-likely"},"3":{"Display":"3-Neutral"},"4":{"Display":"4-Unlikely"},"5":{"Display":"5-Very unlikely"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Please indicate how often you see ads in the following format.<div><br><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q41","QuestionID":"QID41"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9EMz4vUv85Ya5cF","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID45","SecondaryAttribute":"Please indicate the extent to which you agree or disagree with each of the following statements a...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ab063a72-1343-cff3-ddff-e284e39e2b3a\"><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Please indicate the extent to which you agree or disagree with each of the following statements about the spokesperson in the video.<\/span><\/p><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/div><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q7.1","QuestionID":"QID45","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidthPixels":216,"MobileFirst":true,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF"},"QuestionDescription":"Please indicate the extent to which you agree or disagree with each of the following statements a...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"The spokesperson is knowledgeable."},"2":{"Display":"The spokesperson is trustworthy."},"3":{"Display":"The spokesperson is likable."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"2":{"Display":"Disagree"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat disagree"},"4":{"Display":"Neither agree nor disagree"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat agree"},"6":{"Display":"Agree"},"7":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e38eb108-a7c2-c0d9-de71-734af42e0a06\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent;\">Please indicate the extent to which you agree or disagree with each of the following statements about the spokesperson in the video.<\/span><\/p><\/span>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9EMz4vUv85Ya5cF","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID53","SecondaryAttribute":"Please indicate the extent to which you agree or disagree with each of the following statements.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e38eb108-a7c2-c0d9-de71-734af42e0a06\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent;\">Please indicate the extent to which you agree or disagree with each of the following statements.<\/span><\/p><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q7.3","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidthPixels":216,"RepeatHeaders":"none","MobileFirst":true,"WhiteSpace":"OFF"},"QuestionDescription":"Please indicate the extent to which you agree or disagree with each of the following statements.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"The featured product is desirable."},"2":{"Display":"The featured produc